<p>A skip about being stuck on aeroplanes, claustrophobia, and burning.</p>
<p>Yes, this is intended to tie in at least a little to <a href="/scp-2539">SCP-2539</a>'s Miriam Wells and what her ultimate fate was. <span style="color: white">Spoiler: she's forever trapped in transportation hell.</span></p>
<p>Grace Renfield is stolen from <a href="/theysayshelooksjustlikeo5-8">In Case You've Ever Wondered...</a>, partially because it's an underrated tale and partially because of the thematic chords between an airplane filled with Miriam Wells clones and a woman who's a clone herself. Also because Nanku from Samsara would probably try to murder her fellow passengers.</p>
<p><strong>Image attribution:</strong> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2012-12-12_Sydney_Kingsford_Smith_airport._International_arrivals_01.jpg">This</a> image taken by Maksym Kozlenko under CC-SA 4.0.</p>
<p><strong>Crit:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/randomini" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1379080); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1379080&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1495020015" alt="Randomini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1379080)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/randomini" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1379080); return false;">Randomini</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(560062); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=560062&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1495020015" alt="minmin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=560062)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(560062); return false;">minmin</a></span></p>

