			<div class="content" id="post-content-2824062">
									

<p>A lot of this doesn't seem to make sense. People have to spend 2 hours at the gate to be affected, but it only affects flights landing there? So they have to spend 2 hours at the gate and then go somewhere else, and then get a flight heading to that airport and landing at that gate?</p>
